Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Originally merged as one issue.** The parser and booking-v3 hint were separate causes.
The later engineering update closed #4471 on 5 October: the parser was fixed and the
hint was marked won't fix because booking-v3 was retired. See the
[signed resolution page](/kb/incidents/4471-resolution) and
[replacement triage decision](/kb/decisions/0002-dedupe-by-cause).

<Callout>
The tables below record the historical export. The later engineering update reports
the parser fixed and the hint retired, not two repaired defects. The one-day anomalies
remain documented without independent verification of their resolution.
</Callout>

